From ee02243d272227014b8f681fc8d9bcb765b68254 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yago Lasse <yagolasse@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:29:16 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] apu: RECOMP_APU_STATS=1 prints per-second pipeline counters

One [APU-STATS] line per second from the frame thread: full vs
monitor-only frames, SECTL/FECTL, monitor point, voice-frames per voice
list (paused, idle), peak levels at each stage (VP L/R sum, mixbins,
frame_buf as the monitor finds it, the buffer handed to the output),
XAudio2 submits accepted/refused, the source voice's queued buffers and
samples played, and active software-mixer voices. Answers "where does
the audio stop" in one run. Off by default; one branch per site.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/apu/apu_core.c    | 71 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/apu/apu_debug.h   | 34 +++++++++++++++++++++
 src/apu/apu_dsp.c     |  8 +++++
 src/apu/apu_vp.c      | 15 +++++++++
 src/apu/apu_xaudio2.c | 13 ++++++++
 src/apu/apu_xaudio2.h |  4 +++
 6 files changed, 144 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

